# Development Workflow Commands for SAC

## Setup
Builds and installs project dependencies using `uv`.
$ just setup

## Linting
Runs `ruff` across the core source directory (`src/`) to check for style violations and potential errors.
$ just lint

## Testing
Runs the entire test suite using `pytest`.
$ just test

## Single Test
Runs tests for a specific file. Usage: just test-single -- {path/to/test_file.py}
$ just test-single -- {test_file}

## Utility Targets
Sets up common workflows:

### Evaluate Model
Runs the standard evaluation process with video recording for the sparse LiDAR model.
$ just evaluate

## Cleanup
Removes generated model, log, and data files.
$ just clean
